 116:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\drivers/peripheral/syspm/cy_syspm.h **** * * If active core regulator is the Buck, call:
 117:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\drivers/peripheral/syspm/cy_syspm.h **** *   \code{.c}
